    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$CQAR$ গোলকের কেন্দ্র $O$, ব্যাসার্ধ $OA = OB = OC$ এবং কেন্দ্র $O$ থেকে $h$ দূরত্বে $P$ বিন্দুর মধ্য দিয়ে $OA$ রেখার সাথে লম্ব হয় এরূপ একটি সমতল গোলকটিকে ছেদ করে একটি $QBR$ বৃত্ত উৎপন্ন করেছে। এই বৃত্তের কেন্দ্র $P$ এবং ব্যাসার্ধ $PB$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "CQAR",
        "O",
        "OA = OB = OC",
        "O",
        "h",
        "P",
        "OA",
        "QBR",
        "P",
        "PB"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p004",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$\\therefore OB^2 = OP^2 + PB^2$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore OB^2 = OP^2 + PB^2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p005",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$\\therefore PB^2 = OB^2 - OP^2 = r^2 - h^2$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore PB^2 = OB^2 - OP^2 = r^2 - h^2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "গোলকের ব্যাসার্ধ $r$ হলে,",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "r"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ক) গোলকের পৃষ্ঠতলের ক্ষেত্রফল $= 4\\pi r^2$ বর্গ একক।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= 4\\pi r^2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) আয়তন $= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3$ ঘন একক।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "গ) $h$ উচ্চতায় তলচ্ছেদে উৎপন্ন বৃত্তের ব্যাসার্ধ $= \\sqrt{r^2 - h^2}$ একক।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "h",
        "= \\sqrt{r^2 - h^2}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**কাজ:** একটি খেলনা বল বা ফুটবল নিয়ে তার ব্যাসার্ধ ও আয়তন নির্ণয় করো।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [],
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p011",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৫.** ৪ সে.মি. ব্যাসের একটি লৌহ গোলককে পিটিয়ে $\\frac{2}{3}$ সে.মি. পুরু একটি বৃত্তাকার লৌহপাত প্রস্তুত করা হল। ঐ পাতের ব্যাসার্ধ কত?",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{2}{3}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p012",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** লৌহ গোলকের ব্যাসার্ধ $= \\frac{4}{2} = 2$ সে.মি.।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{4}{2} = 2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p013",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ তার আয়তন $= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi \\times 2^3 = \\frac{32}{3}\\pi$ ঘন সে.মি.।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "= \\frac{4}{3}\\pi \\times 2^3 = \\frac{32}{3}\\pi"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p014",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "মনে করি, পাতের ব্যাসার্ধ $= r$ সে.মি.। পাতটি $\\frac{2}{3}$ সে.মি. পুরু।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= r",
        "\\frac{2}{3}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p015",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ পাতের আয়তন $= \\pi r^2 \\times \\frac{2}{3}$ ঘন সে.মি. $= \\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^2$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "= \\pi r^2 \\times \\frac{2}{3}",
        "= \\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 303,
      "pdfPageEnd": 303,
      "printedPageStart": 298,
      "printedPageEnd": 298,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p016",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "শর্তানুসারে, $\\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^2 = \\frac{32}{3}\\pi$ বা, $r^2 = 16$ বা, $r = 4$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^2 = \\frac{32}{3}\\pi",
        "r^2 = 16",
        "r = 4"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p017",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ পাতের ব্যাসার্ধ $= 4$ সে.মি.",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "= 4"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p018",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৬.** সমান উচ্চতা বিশিষ্ট একটি সমবৃত্তভূমিক কোণক, একটি অর্ধ গোলক ও একটি সিলিন্ডার সমান সমান ভূমির উপর অবস্থিত। দেখাও যে, তাদের আয়তনের অনুপাত $1 : 2 : 3$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "1 : 2 : 3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p019",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** মনে করি, সাধারণ উচ্চতা ও ভূমির ব্যাসার্ধ যথাক্রমে $h$ এবং $r$ একক। যেহেতু অর্ধ গোলকের উচ্চতা ও ব্যাসার্ধ সমান সুতরাং, $h = r$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "h",
        "r",
        "h = r"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p020",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তাহলে কোণকের আয়তন $= \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^2 h = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^3$ ঘন একক",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^2 h = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "known-confusable-corrected",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p021",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "অর্ধ গোলকের আয়তন $= \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3) = \\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^3$ ঘন একক",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3) = \\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "known-confusable-corrected",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p022",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "সিলিন্ডারের আয়তন $= \\pi r^2 h = \\pi r^3$ ঘন একক",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\pi r^2 h = \\pi r^3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "known-confusable-corrected",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p023",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ নির্ণেয় অনুপাত $= \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^3 : \\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^3 : \\pi r^3 = \\frac{1}{3} : \\frac{2}{3} : 1 = 1 : 2 : 3$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "= \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^3 : \\frac{2}{3}\\pi r^3 : \\pi r^3 = \\frac{1}{3} : \\frac{2}{3} : 1 = 1 : 2 : 3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p024",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৭.** একটি আয়তাকার লৌহফলকের দৈর্ঘ্য, প্রস্থ ও উচ্চতা যথাক্রমে $10, 8$ ও $5\\frac{1}{2}$ সে.মি.। এই ফলকটিকে গলিয়ে $\\frac{1}{2}$ সে.মি. ব্যাসার্ধ বিশিষ্ট কতগুলো গোলকার গুলি প্রস্তুত করা যাবে?",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "10, 8",
        "5\\frac{1}{2}",
        "\\frac{1}{2}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p025",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** লৌহফলকের আয়তন $= 10 \\times 8 \\times 5\\frac{1}{2}$ ঘন সে.মি. $= 440$ ঘন সে.মি.",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= 10 \\times 8 \\times 5\\frac{1}{2}",
        "= 440"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "known-confusable-corrected",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p026",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "মনে করি, গুলির সংখ্যা $= n$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= n"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p027",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore n$ সংখ্যক গুলির আয়তন $= n \\times \\frac{4}{3}\\pi(\\frac{1}{2})^3 = \\frac{n\\pi}{6}$ ঘন সে.মি.",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore n",
        "= n \\times \\frac{4}{3}\\pi(\\frac{1}{2})^3 = \\frac{n\\pi}{6}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "known-confusable-corrected",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p028",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "প্রশ্নানুসারে, $\\frac{n\\pi}{6} = 440$ বা, $n = \\frac{440 \\times 6}{\\pi} = 840.34$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{n\\pi}{6} = 440",
        "n = \\frac{440 \\times 6}{\\pi} = 840.34"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p029",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ নির্ণেয় গুলির সংখ্যা $840$ টি।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "840"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 304,
      "pdfPageEnd": 304,
      "printedPageStart": 299,
      "printedPageEnd": 299,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.12-p030",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
